        "CopyrightInformation": "This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The prevalence of obesity and type 2 diabetes have increased concomitantly in the United States (US) during the last thirty years.(1,2,3) Obesity, in particular abdominal obesity, is also a major risk factor for type 2 diabetes,(4,5) suggesting that the increase in the prevalence of obesity has contributed, at least in part, to the increase in the prevalence of type 2 diabetes."
